Task 1: Import assert.yml
Description Task 1: Import the assert.yml file for assertions, to be executed once and delegated to localhost.

Task 2: Wait for port to be available
Description Task 2: Wait for a specified port to be available, using a timeout defined by bootstrap_timeout variable, under specific connection conditions.

Task 3: Prepare system
Description Task 3: Prepare the system by testing the connection and sudo, running as root without the ability to switch users.

Task 4: Gather bootstrap facts
Description Task 4: If preparation encounters issues, gather additional facts about the bootstrap environment.

Task 5: Install bootstrap packages (raw)
Description Task 5: Install necessary bootstrap packages using raw commands, adjusting for different operating system families.

Task 6: Ensure libdnf5 is present on Fedora/RedHat
Description Task 6: Ensure the libdnf5 package is installed on systems running Fedora or RedHat.

Task 7: Gather ansible facts
Description Task 7: Gather system facts using the setup module.

Task 8: Install bootstrap packages (package)
Description Task 8: Install bootstrap packages using the package module, updating the cache if necessary.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- import_playbook: assert.yml
  delegate_to: localhost

- name: Wait for port to be available
  wait_for:
    port: 22
    timeout: "{{ bootstrap_timeout }}"
    connect_timeout: 5
    host: "{{ inventory_hostname }}"

- name: Prepare system
  setup:
    run_tags: always
  changed_when: False
  become: yes
  become_method: sudo
  become_flags: '-n -q'

- name: Gather bootstrap facts
  setup:
    gather_subset: 'all'

- name: Install bootstrap packages (raw)
  raw:
    cmd: |
      if [ -f /etc/os-release ]; then
        case $ID in
          Fedora|RedHat) echo "yum" ;;
          *) echo "apt-get" ;;
        esac
      else
        echo "dpkg"
      fi
      | bash -c "yum -y install {{ bootstrap_packages }} || apt-get -y install {{ bootstrap_packages }} || dpkg -i {{ bootstrap_packages }}"
      > /dev/null 2>&1
  when: prepare_system.changed

- name: Ensure libdnf5 is present on Fedora/RedHat
  apt:
    name: libdnf5
    state: present
  when: ansible_distribution in ['Fedora', 'RedHat']

- name: Gather ansible facts
  setup:
    gather_subset: 'all'

- name: Install bootstrap packages (package)
  package:
    name: "{{ bootstrap_packages }}"
    state: present
  when: prepare_system.changed


